Well, don't know how to do it for BF2 but you reference the .mus in you .req for the era your doing. In the .mus is somthing like
Music()
{
Name("rep_cor_amb_start");
Priority(1.0);
FadeInTime(0.0);
FadeOutTime(1.5);
MinPlaybackTime(20.0);
MaxPlaybackTime(180.0);
