There are 2 lists for command posts in the lua.
The First:
Code:
Select all
--This defines the CPs.  These need to happen first
    cp1 = CommandPost:New{name = "cp1"}
    cp2 = CommandPost:New{name = "cp2"}
    cp3 = CommandPost:New{name = "cp3"}
    cp4 = CommandPost:New{name = "cp4"}
The Second:
Code:
Select all
conquest:AddCommandPost(cp1)
    conquest:AddCommandPost(cp2)
    conquest:AddCommandPost(cp3)
    conquest:AddCommandPost(cp4)
The first actually adds the command posts to the game.  All command posts, capturable or non capturable, need to be in there.  The second one adds the command posts to the objective.  It lists which command posts need to be possessed in order for the victory counter to start ticking.  So, you need to add local_cp to the first list, so it looks like this:
Code:
Select all
--This defines the CPs.  These need to happen first
    cp1 = CommandPost:New{name = "cp1"}
    cp2 = CommandPost:New{name = "cp2"}
    cp3 = CommandPost:New{name = "cp3"}
    cp4 = CommandPost:New{name = "cp4"}
    cp5 = CommandPost:New{name = "local_cp"}
That should fix it.

